      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Are you alright?",
      "JA_current": "大丈夫か？",
      "JA_new": "大丈夫か？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 9,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I'm hurt damn it, don't you see that? I need a medkit or at least a bandage.",
      "JA_current": "くそ！ やられたよ。包帯か Medkit を分けてくれないか？",
      "JA_new": "くそっ、見りゃ分かるだろ？ 医療キットか、せめて包帯をくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_11#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 12,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_11",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Here, take this medkit.",
      "JA_current": "ほら、Medkit だ。",
      "JA_new": "ほら、医療キットだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "11",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_12#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 18,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_12",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Here, take this bandage.",
      "JA_current": "包帯だ。使えよ。",
      "JA_new": "ほら、包帯だ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "12",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_13#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 21,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_13",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Sorry, I don't have any.",
      "JA_current": "すまん。持ってないんだ。",
      "JA_new": "悪い、持ってないんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "13",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_14#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 27,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_14",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Sorry man. But if I give you mine I won't have any left for myself.",
      "JA_current": "ごめんよ。余分な持ち合わせが無いんだ。",
      "JA_new": "悪いな。自分の分を渡したら、俺の分がなくなっちまう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "14",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 15,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Thanks bro, I won't forget it.",
      "JA_current": "ありがとう。恩に着るよ。",
      "JA_new": "ありがとう、兄弟。恩に着るよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_131#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 24,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_131",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So how do you go around the Zone then? What if you're infected or something? You won't even be able to heal yourself!",
      "JA_current": "だがどうやってゾーンを回るんだい？ 例えば、アンタが病気なんかに感染した時なんかは？ アンタ自身じゃ治せやしないだろ！",
      "JA_new": "じゃあ、どうやってゾーンを歩き回るんだ？ 感染症にでもかかったらどうする？ 自分で治療もできないだろ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "131",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs:actor_help_wounded_141#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 30,
      "string_id": "actor_help_wounded_141",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "It's your business, but it doesn't do you any good.",
      "JA_current": "そりゃアンタの問題だが、アンタの為にゃならないぜ？",
      "JA_new": "あんたの勝手だが、それじゃ自分のためにならないぞ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "actor_help_wounded",
          "phrase_id": "141",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs.xml"
        }
      ]
    }
